Create custom chat scenes for videos, stories, presentations, school projects, mockups and creative content.

Faker 2 is a chat simulator and visual editor that lets you design fictional conversations and turn them into custom chat images.

Create your chat scene in a few simple steps:

1. Create a chat scene.
2. Add a character name.
3. Build the conversation with your own messages.
4. Customize the appearance and save your creation.

Use Faker 2 for:
• Video and movie props;
• Social media content;
• Chat stories;
• Storyboards and creative concepts;
• School and presentation projects;
• UI mockups and demonstrations.

Upgrade to the Plus Pack to unlock additional editing tools:
• Create more than 2 chat scenes;
• Add more than 5 messages per scene;
• Adjust the time for each message;
• Customize message states;
• Customize character status;
• Add character photos;
• Add images to conversations.

Choose from a variety of visual chat styles and themes to create the appearance that works best for your project.

Faker 2 is a visual chat simulator. It does not connect to messaging services, send messages, contact other users, or modify conversations in any third-party application. All conversations created in the app are fictional visual compositions made by the user.

